---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy information" simpleFooter>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Clear by design</p>
    <h1>Your <em>privacy.</em></h1>
    <p>This notice describes the current website{site.enquiryEndpoint ? ', the journey planner and the contact form.' : ' and local journey planner.'} It is not a booking-service privacy notice.</p>

    <h2>Your journey brief</h2>
    <p>{site.enquiryEndpoint ? 'The planner processes the information you type within the current page in your browser. When you submit, your entries — and any contact-form message — are sent to a third-party form-delivery service, which relays them to Pardus by email. They are not used for advertising and are not sold. Downloading also creates a text file on your device.' : 'The planner processes the information you type within the current page in your browser. It does not send your entries to Pardus, an email provider, a CRM or an analytics service. Downloading creates a text file on your device.'} Treat that file as personal information if it contains your name or travel plans.</p>

    <h2>Your saved preferences</h2>
    <p>The Pardus Folio saves your selected place, pace, reason and journey or destination bookmarks in this browser’s local storage. These preferences stay on your device and expire in the website after 30 days without a change. Use “Clear Folio” to remove your saved preferences at any time.</p>
    <p>The journey planner saves a draft in this tab’s session storage as you type. This includes any name, contact details and travel notes you enter, so you can return to the planner during the same browser session. Closing the tab normally ends that session; browser restoration behaviour may vary. {site.enquiryEndpoint && 'The saved draft is also cleared after successful online delivery.'} You can remove stored website data through your browser settings.</p>
    <p>A separate session-only flag remembers whether the opening introduction has played. It contains no traveller information and is not used for tracking. Folio preferences and planner drafts are not shared with Pardus unless you submit them through a connected enquiry service.</p>

    <h2>Hosting and assets</h2>
    <p>Images, scripts and the Satoshi, Montserrat and Fraunces fonts are served with the website. Loading these fonts does not make a request to Fontshare or another external font service. {site.analyticsId ? 'Cloudflare Web Analytics measures aggregate visits to help us understand site performance; it is cookieless and does not track you individually across sites.' : 'We have not added analytics, advertising pixels or third-party tracking scripts.'} The hosting provider may process routine request information, such as your IP address and browser details, to deliver the site under its own policies.</p>

    <h2>{site.enquiryEndpoint ? 'Enquiry delivery' : 'Future enquiry delivery'}</h2>
    <p>{site.enquiryEndpoint ? 'Journey briefs and contact-form messages are relayed to Pardus by a third-party form-delivery service acting on our behalf, for the sole purpose of responding to your enquiry. We do not currently retain a copy beyond that service’s own delivery records.' : 'If online enquiries or other services are connected, this notice will need to identify the responsible business, approved contact channel, service providers, purposes, retention arrangements and applicable privacy rights before that processing begins.'}</p>

    <h2>What not to enter</h2>
    <p>Please do not enter passport numbers, payment details, passwords or sensitive medical information in this general planning tool.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
